1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,598
Ten machines. The same file.
Only one upstream download.

2
00:00:05,248 --> 00:00:09,899
When several clients request the same
file at once and it is not cached yet,

3
00:00:09,949 --> 00:00:13,613
Cache & Carry does not have
to download it ten times.

4
00:00:13,713 --> 00:00:17,202
One upstream download serves
every waiting client.

5
00:00:17,852 --> 00:00:20,842
For your homelab. Open source on GitHub.
